    "done_when": "Per §5 of the plan: crew budget --reset --used reports its reach, reading follower_registration.list_followers for every mounted project and deriving no liveness of its own: the sessions holding a live registration, whose panes will draw the row, and the sessions holding only registrations that are not live, listed in the command's output and its JSON document; the report writes nothing. A test in a temporary home with one session holding a live follower registration and one holding a stale one finds the first reached and the second not. Every test file importing the changed modules or exercising crew budget, rebuilt from the head tree, adds no failure against a base arm, both arms from git checkouts under the run's own scratch directory with RECKON_SESSION_HOST_SETTLE, RECKON_FOLLOWER_OWNER, RECKON_FOLLOWER_IMAGE_COMMIT and RECKON_FOLLOWER_SOURCE_ROOT unset, run in place on the fleet node with pytest -n 8; any id failing in one arm only is run five times alone in each arm; thirteen tests driving retired budget verbs fail at base and are expected in both arms. Every log is under the run directory, starts with its revision and the literal command, and ends in EXIT=. ruff check and ruff format --check add no findings on the changed files, judged against the base blobs.",
